                                                  \begin{document}$${RC}=1.96\sqrt{2}\cdot {within}\,{subject}\,{standard}\,{deviation}\left({wSD}\right)=2.77\cdot {wSD}$$\end{document}RC=1.962⋅withinsubjectstandarddeviationwSD=2.77⋅wSDSince repeated baseline measurements within individual patients were not available, \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
