                                                  \setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
                                                  \begin{document}$${wSD}$$\end{document}wSD was derived from the baseline SFU measurements across all 12 patients. For each patient, a 95% confidence interval (CI) for the observed change was then calculated as:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
